-    coordinates (``protocol.fingerprint_collision``: (16 steps - 1)^8 / p^8 ~ 2^-171 at 48 steps), or H must open a
-    Poseidon2 preimage of the leaf digest other than the committed row.  ``pubs`` of :meth:`prove_vus` /
